msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_SKILL.md:151
msgid "Brightness — Use `tonemap()`, Not Linear Multipliers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_SKILL.md:153
msgid ""
"This is the #1 visual issue. ASCII on black is inherently dark. **Never "
"use `canvas * N` multipliers** — they clip highlights. Use adaptive "
"tonemap:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_SKILL.md:164
msgid "Pipeline: `scene_fn() → tonemap() → FeedbackBuffer → ShaderChain → ffmpeg`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_SKILL.md:166
msgid ""
"Per-scene gamma: default 0.75, solarize 0.55, posterize 0.50, bright "
"scenes 0.85. Use `screen` blend (not `overlay`) for dark layers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_SKILL.md:168
msgid "Font Cell Height"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_SKILL.md:170
msgid ""
"macOS Pillow: `textbbox()` returns wrong height. Use `font.getmetrics()`:"
" `cell_height = ascent + descent`. See `references/troubleshooting.md`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_SKILL.md:172
msgid "ffmpeg Pipe Deadlock"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_SKILL.md:174
msgid ""
"Never `stderr=subprocess.PIPE` with long-running ffmpeg — buffer fills at"
" 64KB and deadlocks. Redirect to file. See "
"`references/troubleshooting.md`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_SKILL.md:176
msgid "Font Compatibility"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ascii-video_SKILL.md:178
msgid ""
"Not all Unicode chars render in all fonts. Validate palettes at init — "
"render each char, check for blank output. See "
"`references/troubleshooting.md`."
msgstr ""

